# Gameplay test T1 (the gameplay test plan): fire, reload, switch weapon, grenade, melee at the
# scanner gate of mission_0. Appended to the fast menu script (tools/pad/menu-fast.pad through tools/level-run.sh)
# that gets the run to the level load at ~38 s (level start ~111 s after the loading cinematic); the player stands
# at the gate from the level start, so the presses start at load+297 = 335 s (the old pad-r12 timing was 420 s with
# the load at 122.7 s: same offset).
#   tools/level-run.sh gp-t1 --pad tools/pad/t1-fire.pad     (KZ3_VIDEO=330:30 for the clip)
#   or by hand: PAD_SCRIPT="$(cat tools/pad/menu-fast.pad tools/pad/t1-fire.pad)" (a 3006 exe: comments are fine)
# Grammar: port/patches/3006-cellpad-script-v2.patch. Masks (Standard scheme, the RE notes 5.3):
# R1 fire 0x0800, SQUARE reload 0x8000, TRIANGLE next weapon 0x1000, R2 quick throw 0x0200, L1 close combat 0x0400.
335:0x0800/1.0     # R1: a one-second burst (HUD ammo count drops, muzzle flash)
340:0x8000         # SQUARE: reload (default 40-poll tap; ammo refills)
345:0x1000         # TRIANGLE: next weapon (weapon model swaps)
350:0x0200/0.5     # R2: quick throw, half a second so a 0.4 s tap cannot be the reason it is ignored
355:0x0400/0.5     # L1: melee
